  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engagement Facility - IGI-  Youth Innovation and Entrepreneurship Catalyst</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Youth Empowerment Project is to empower Egyptian youth by promoting entrepreneurship, innovation, and skilling, upskilling, and reskilling. It aims for a strengthened enabling environment for entrepreneurship. The project aims to provide young people with access to information, resources, and services that will enable them to build successful careers and pursue their desired career paths. The Youth Empowerment Project also aims to support the development of a more efficient and resilient innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
